      "nudge",
      "data structure",
      "partial approach"
    ]
  },
  "hints": [
    "All values are positive, so growing a window only increases its sum.",
    "Use two pointers for the window's left and right ends.",
    "Extend right; while the sum is >= target, record the length and move left forward."
